cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the version of the software used for your analysis."
title: "Analysis code for Temporal Heterogeneity in the Trading Volume–Return Relationship in Colombian Equities: A Function-on-Function Regression Approach"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24490518"
abstract: >-
  This R workflow examines the relationship between trading volume and stock returns for 13 Colombian equities 
  using function-on-function regression. It produces 24 EPS figures, 24 CSV files with numerical results, and an R session 
  information file. Reproducing the analysis requires financial data from Investing.com, which users must obtain under 
  the provider’s terms. The DATA_ACCESS.md file describes the required inputs and how to prepare them for the analysis.
authors:
  - family-names: "Pava-Parra"
    given-names: "Gustavo A."
    affiliation: "Universidad Nacional de Colombia"
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0004-6503-8533
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Functional data analysis
  - function-on-function regression
  - trading volume
  - stock returns
  - Colombian stock market
